2026-10-16T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-2319) 'a serving host's certificate comes from agent CA v2
 # uuid: f13fe6ec-3506-52ef-9038-7aa61e346c7c
 # tags: rfd:title
 RFD:Committed  1 RFD
 Serials:VSekaiFabric

2026-10-16T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2319) 'a host that serves on the tailnet gets a server certificate for its own agent identity, signed by Bao's agent CA v2 without the root token
 # tags: rfd:feature, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2319) 'weftspun-bao's `pki-agents` and `pki-agents-v2` mounts, the `csr-signer` policy, and every stunnel or edge endpoint that serves under an agent identity
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2319) 'A serving host gets its tailnet server certificate from agent CA v2, with no root token.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2319) 'Bao has two agent CAs, and nothing said which one does what. Bao signs a certificate in `pki-agents` that names the tailnet host anyway, and every client then rejects it.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2319) 'Read below for the mounts and the `agent-endpoint` role.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2319) 'a serving host's certificate comes from agent CA v2
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2319) 'A host that serves takes a second certificate for its agent name from the `pki-agents-v2` mount, through role `agent-endpoint`. That role sets server and client use, allows `*.agents.weftspun`, `*.stonecat-ratio.ts.net` and tailnet addresses, caps a certificate at 90 days and stores no record of it. The `csr-signer` policy may sign through it, so an agent identity issues an endpoint certificate without the root token. The key is made on the host and never leaves it.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2319) '- RFD66606-2142 (Bao PKI service TLS), the first PKI mount.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2319) '- RFD66606-2145 (certificate lifetimes), the 90-day leaf ceiling.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2319) '- RFD66606-2316 (Bao bounded storage), why no record is stored.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2319) '- RFD66606-2311 (Bonsai 2 serving), the first host to need this.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2319) 'What failed
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2319) '`pki-agents` holds the agent CA, whose name constraints allow only `chibifire.com` and `agents.weftspun`. On 2026-10-16 a server certificate for the Linux 4090 host failed this way.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2319) 'Sources
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2319) 'Read on 2026-10-16 from the live cluster through the active `weftspun-fdb` machine: each mount's CA certificate and name constraints, the `csr-signer` policy, and the issuers on `pki-agents`. The Authority Information Access field of the Mac's own server certificate named `pki-agents-v2`, which is how that mount was found.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2319) 'The mounts
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2319) '- `pki-agents`: issuer chibifire.com agent CA, constrained to `chibifire.com` and `agents.weftspun`. An agent signs with `agent-client`: client use only, 1 year.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2319) '- `pki-agents-v2`: issuer chibifire.com agent CA v2, constrained to the two above, `stonecat-ratio.ts.net` and `100.64.0.0/10`. An agent signs with `agent-endpoint` (this RFD).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2319) '- `pki`: issuer Intermediate CA v2, no constraints read. No agent role; its key is unreadable on the node.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2319) '- `pki-listener`: issuer bao listener CA, constrained to Bao's own names. Bao's listener only.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-2319) 'Every issuer chains to the chibifire.com Root CA, so a client that trusts the Root (`~/.bao.d/server-ca.pem` on the Mac) verifies both agent CAs.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-2319) 'The role
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-2319) '    pki-agents-v2/roles/agent-endpoint
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-2319) '      allowed_domains   agents.weftspun,stonecat-ratio.ts.net
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-2319) '      allow_subdomains  true
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-2319) '      allow_ip_sans     true
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-2319) '      enforce_hostnames true
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2319) '      server_flag       true
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2319) '      client_flag       true
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-2319) '      use_csr_sans      true
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2319) '      ttl, max_ttl      2160h
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2319) '      no_store          true
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-2319) 'With `no_store`, Bao keeps no copy and cannot revoke the certificate. Each one expires within 90 days, which is the revocation (RFD66606-2316). The login certificate an agent already holds stays as it is; the endpoint certificate is a second one for the same name.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-2319) 'Issuing one
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2319) '1. On the host, make a P-256 key and a request whose config file carries `extendedKeyUsage=serverAuth,clientAuth` and the subject names: the agent name, the host's `stonecat-ratio.ts.net` name and its tailnet address.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-2319) '2. Copy only the request off the host. An agent signs it with `pki-agents-v2/sign/agent-endpoint` under its own cert login.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-2319) '3. Install the leaf with agent CA v2 after it as the full chain, and leave the Root out of the chain.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-2319) 'Witnesses
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-2319) '- **Chain.** `openssl verify -purpose sslserver` of the leaf against the Root, with agent CA v2 as the untrusted intermediate, prints OK. The same request signed on `pki-agents` fails with error 47, permitted subtree violation.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:40Z (RFD66606-2319) '- **Use.** A client-only `agent-client` leaf fails the same check with error 26, unsupported certificate purpose.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:41Z (RFD66606-2319) '- **Signer.** `bao token capabilities pki-agents-v2/sign/agent-endpoint` under an agent cert login returns create and update.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:42Z (RFD66606-2319) 'The first two controls were run on 2026-10-16 and failed as planted, and the passing case ran the same day on the certificate below.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:43Z (RFD66606-2319) 'What went wrong first
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:44Z (RFD66606-2319) 'On 2026-10-16 the role was written on `pki-agents`, the mount the client role lives on. It signed a certificate for the Linux host that failed error 47, and that certificate (serial `28:01:5a:de`) was revoked the same hour. A role named `agent-endpoint` already existed there and was overwritten without being read, so its earlier settings are lost. The `csr-signer` policy gained `pki-agents/sign/agent-endpoint` in the same write. Both were removed later that day, when the role was written on `pki-agents-v2`.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:45Z (RFD66606-2319) '`pki-agents-v2` already carried `agent-endpoint` and `agent-client`, both allowing `agents.weftspun`, `stonecat-ratio.ts.net` and tailnet addresses. The existing `agent-endpoint` had a one-year ceiling and stored each certificate; this RFD's write changed it to 90 days and `no_store`. The Mac's own server certificate came from that role before the change.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:46Z (RFD66606-2319) 'The operator then requested the old settings back. Only the root token can write the role, and it sits in the password manager, which routine work does not use. The operator kept the 90-day role and had both certificates rotated through it instead.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:47Z (RFD66606-2319) 'The certificates in use
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:48Z (RFD66606-2319) 'Both were rotated on 2026-10-16 with a fresh P-256 key made on each host and signed by the Mac agent identity with no root token. Each is valid to 2027-01-14, passes the chain gate, and matches its key.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:49Z (RFD66606-2319) '- `fedora-9a6c28.agents.weftspun`, serial `5d:9c:e6:f3`, at `~/.bao-creds/fedora-9a6c28/srv-fullchain.pem`. It replaces serial `21:f0:0c:1d`, issued earlier the same day, never served, and deleted with its key.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-16T00:00:50Z (RFD66606-2319) '- `mac-mini-fire-01b8f5.agents.weftspun`, serial `3e:dd:70:c0`, at `~/.bao-creds/mac-mini-fire-01b8f5/srv-fullchain.pem`. It replaces serial `60:1e:4b:98`, a one-year certificate from the old role. No agent identity may revoke on `pki-agents-v2`, so that one stays valid to 2027-10-12; nothing on the Mac reads it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2319  1 LINE
 Text:Written
